  "contentHtml": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Paperwork will follow you everywhere. From planning a project to starting a business, everything requires a documented procedure. And not only any paperwork, but also official, government-approved documents, are a must to review. That’s where </span><b>MOFA attestation</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> steps in.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many people ask, </span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What is MOFA attestation</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">? And why does everyone talk about it during visa or business processes? For all of them, the answer is simple: an MOFA attestation confirms that your foreign-issued documents are genuine. Plus, they’re legally valid inside the UAE. Reminding you that your certificates may not hold any official value without it.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We’ll discuss the essential details of the </span><b>MOFA attestation in the UAE</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in this blog post. Don’t skip any part, or you’ll miss the required documents checklist. Walk through the steps involved, timelines, and smart tips to avoid delays.</span></p>\n<div class=\"lwptoc lwptoc-autoWidth lwptoc-baseItems lwptoc-light lwptoc-notInherit\" data-smooth-scroll=\"1\" data-smooth-scroll-offset=\"24\"><div class=\"lwptoc_i\">    <div class=\"lwptoc_header\">\n        <b class=\"lwptoc_title\">Contents</b>                    <span class=\"lwptoc_toggle\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"lwptoc_toggle_label\" data-label=\"show\">hide</a>            </span>\n            </div>\n<div class=\"lwptoc_items lwptoc_items-visible\">\n    <div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\"><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Why_Does_MOFA_Attestation_Have_So_Much_Significance\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Why Does MOFA Attestation Have So Much Significance?</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Importance_for_Smooth_Business_Operations\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Importance for Smooth Business Operations:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Types_of_Documents_Necessitating_MOFA_Attestation\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Types of Documents Necessitating MOFA Attestation:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Steps_to_Get_MOFA_Attestation_in_the_UAE\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Steps to Get MOFA Attestation in the UAE:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#MOFA_Attestation_for_Documents_Issued_Abroad\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">MOFA Attestation for Documents Issued Abroad:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Tricks_for_Easy_MOFA_Attestation\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Tricks for Easy MOFA Attestation:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Final_Words\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Final Words:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#FAQ\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">FAQ:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div></div></div>\n</div></div><h2 id=\"why-does-mofa-attestation-have-so-much-significance\"><b>Why Does MOFA Attestation Have So Much Significance?</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The UAE does not accept foreign-issued documents. That’s why authorities require verification. Helps prevent fraud and ensure authenticity. </span><b>MOFA attestation</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> serves as the Ministry of Foreign Affairs’ final legal stamp. It confirms that your document has passed all required checks. </span><b>MOFA UAE attestation</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> makes your paperwork usable inside the country. It’s either you apply for a job, obtain a family visa, or get a business license. Your application may be rejected or delayed without it.</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/contact-us/\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-10454 size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-Attestation-in-the-UAE-1024x683.webp\" alt=\"mofa attestation UAE\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-10454 size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-Attestation-in-the-UAE-1024x683.webp\" alt=\"mofa attestation UAE\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-Attestation-in-the-UAE-1024x683.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-Attestation-in-the-UAE-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-Attestation-in-the-UAE-768x512.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-Attestation-in-the-UAE.webp 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></noscript></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"importance-for-smooth-business-operations\"><b>Importance for Smooth Business Operations:</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Documentation errors can disrupt serious opportunities. However, entrepreneurs and professionals need to be very smart at this stage. They make sure that proper attestation is in place. This keeps operations running without unnecessary complications.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"avoiding-disruptive-delays\"><b>Avoiding Disruptive Delays:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Missing an attestation can pause employment visa processing. Your business license approvals will be stopped. It creates a roadblock to contract registrations and government clearances. You prevent last-minute document rejections by completing document attestation</span><b>&nbsp;in Dubai</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> correctly. Assists you in protecting your timeline.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"adherence-to-uae-regulations\"><b>Adherence to UAE Regulations:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The UAE maintains strict compliance standards. Government departments require officially verified documents before granting approvals. </span><b>Dubai MOFA attestation</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a key that ensures your paperwork aligns with national legal standards. It supports smooth interactions with authorities.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"protecting-your-interests\"><b>Protecting Your Interests:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Attested documents safeguard your educational qualifications, business agreements, and personal status records. Verified paperwork protects your legal standing. It also strengthens your credibility in professional and commercial environments.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"types-of-documents-necessitating-mofa-attestation\"><b>Types of Documents Necessitating MOFA Attestation:</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Different purposes require different documents. Below are the familiar categories that require </span><b>UAE MOFA attestation</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Unsure about requirements? Professional </span><a href=\"/uae-attestation/\"><b>UAE Attestation Services</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is the way to go. They’d better guide you through the correct sequence.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"commercial-corporate-documents\"><b>Commercial &amp; Corporate Documents:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Businesses often need attestation for</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"/types-of-trade-license/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trade licenses</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Memorandum of Association</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Power of attorney</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Board resolutions</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Commercial invoices</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Expanding into the UAE? You may rely on the </span><b>MOFA attestation in Dubai</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. They validate corporate documents for legal operations.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"required-certificates\"><b>Required Certificates:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For employment or higher studies, you may need the following:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Degree certificates</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Diplomas</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Academic transcripts</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Training certificates</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As an employer, you require an </span><b>MOFA attestation in Dubai</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. This confirms educational authenticity before issuing work permits.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"personal-status-documents\"><b>Personal Status Documents:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For family sponsorship or civil procedures, the requirement is</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Birth certificates</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Marriage certificates</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Divorce certificates</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These documents require proper </span><b>MOFA attestation UAE</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Right before the authorities process family visas.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"police-clearance-certificates\"><b>Police Clearance Certificates:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Immigration and licensing authorities often request attested police clearance certificates. They need it to confirm your legal standing.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"medical-reports\"><b>Medical Reports:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Certain visa categories require verified medical certificates issued abroad.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"legal-documents\"><b>Legal Documents:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Court judgments, affidavits, and notarized agreements are required. Legal documents must complete the full attestation chain. The step is necessary to do before MOFA stamps them for UAE use.</span></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9971\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-e1774239848859-1024x361.webp\" alt=\"mofa attestation dubai\" width=\"1024\" height=\"361\"><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9971\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-e1774239848859-1024x361.webp\" alt=\"mofa attestation dubai\" width=\"1024\" height=\"361\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-e1774239848859-1024x361.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-e1774239848859-300x106.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-e1774239848859-768x270.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-e1774239848859-1536x541.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/MOFA-e1774239848859.webp 1988w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></noscript></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 id=\"steps-to-get-mofa-attestation-in-the-uae\"><b>Steps to Get MOFA Attestation in the UAE:</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can complete </span><b>MOFA attestation online</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. The process can be done through the official MOFA website or mobile app. The whole procedure remains simple. Follow the correct steps shared below.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"prepare-the-original-document\"><b>Prepare the Original Document:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Make sure your document carries an attestation. It should be from the issuing country’s foreign affairs authority. Do this before applying. Confirm that the UAE embassy/consulate in that country has legalized it. MOFA will reject your request without these prior stamps.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"apply-for-mofa-attestation\"><b>Apply for MOFA Attestation:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These steps must be followed:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the MOFA UAE website or mobile app.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Select “Document Attestation.”</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Log in using UAE Pass.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose “Attestation inside the UAE.”</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Confirm previous foreign attestations.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enter personal and courier details.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pay the required fee online.</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The system calculates MOFA and courier charges.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"receive-your-attested-document\"><b>Receive Your Attested Document:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A courier collects your document and delivers it to MOFA. They return it to your address after stamping. This streamlined </span><b>document attestation</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> system saves time. It also avoids in-person visits.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"mofa-attestation-for-documents-issued-abroad\"><b>MOFA Attestation for Documents Issued Abroad:</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You must complete multiple stages before applying for the </span><b>UAE MOFA attestation</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. These stages are required for documents issued outside the UAE:</span></p>\n<p><b>Number 1 →</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Attestation from the foreign country’s Ministry of Foreign Affairs.</span></p>\n<p><b>Number 2 →</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Legalization from the UAE embassy in that country.</span></p>\n<p><b>Number 3 →</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Final MOFA attestation inside the UAE.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At every level, this layered verification confirms authenticity. Don’t skip any step. Missing any step leads to rejection. So, always verify the sequence—the things you need to do before submitting your application.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"tricks-for-easy-mofa-attestation\"><b>Tricks for Easy MOFA Attestation:</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experience a hassle-free process. These tips can help:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Before applying, double-check prior attestations.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Be sure your names match passport details exactly.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Upload accurate document information online.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Select a courier speed urgently.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keep aside the fee confirmation receipts.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A quick overview has been shared in a tabular form:</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Step</b></td>\n<td><b>Key Focus</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pre-check</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Verify embassy and foreign MOFA stamps</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Online Application</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enter accurate document details</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Payment</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Confirm updated fee structure</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Courier</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Schedule a convenient pickup</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Make a safe move by planning carefully. It prevents delays and assures smooth processing for </span><b>mofa attestation in Dubai.</b></p>\n<h2 id=\"final-words\"><b>Final Words:</b></h2>\n<p><b>MOFA attestation</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> plays a vital role. You can’t ignore their importance. They make your foreign documents legally valid in the UAE. Aids you in employment visas and business setup. Timely attestation also supports your family sponsorship. Proper attestation makes your procedure easy. It prevents delays and protects your interests.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Be proactive and plan. It is suggested to follow the correct steps. Be sure about the accuracy at every stage. </span><b>MOFA attestation in the UAE</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> becomes a smooth process when handled properly. It keeps your professional and personal journey moving forward confidently!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get along with <a href=\"/\">KPM PRO</a> if the MOFA attestation feels hard for you. We’re the perfect pick that makes your entire attestation process easier than you think! Contact us today and see how we can help.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"faq\"><b>FAQ:</b></h2>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\" id=\"1-is-mofa-attestation-mandatory-for-a-uae-residence-visa\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. Is MOFA attestation mandatory for a UAE residence visa?</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Yes. Whether you are applying for an employment visa, a family sponsorship visa, or a gold visa, the UAE government requires MOFA attestation to verify that your foreign certificates (degree, marriage, or birth) are authentic and legally recognized within the country.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"4\" id=\"2-can-i-complete-the-uae-mofa-attestation-process-online\"><b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Can I complete the UAE MOFA attestation process online?</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Absolutely. You can initiate the process via the official <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"117\">MOFA website</b> or the <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"137\">MOFA UAE mobile app</b>. After paying the fees online and choosing a courier service (like Emirates Post or Aramex), the courier will collect your physical documents, have them stamped at the ministry, and return them to your doorstep.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\" id=\"3-what-are-the-mofa-attestation-fees-in-the-uae-for-2026\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. What are the MOFA attestation fees in the UAE for 2026?</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">The standard fee for attesting individual documents (like educational or personal certificates) is <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"158\">AED 150</b>. For commercial and corporate documents, the fees are significantly higher, typically starting around <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"268\">AED 2,000</b>. Note that courier and service charges are calculated separately during the application.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"6\" id=\"4-how-many-days-does-it-take-to-get-a-document-attested-by-mofa\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. How many days does it take to get a document attested by MOFA?</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\">The standard processing time is <b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">0 to 3 working days</b>. However, this depends on the courier speed you select (Normal, Next Day, or Express) and the accuracy of your application. Most digital-first applications are processed within 48 hours.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\" id=\"5-why-was-my-mofa-attestation-request-rejected\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5. Why was my MOFA attestation request rejected?</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">The most common reasons for rejection include:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Missing Prior Stamps:</b> Your document must be attested by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in the issuing country and the UAE Embassy there <i data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"137\">before</i> applying to MOFA UAE.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lamination:</b> MOFA cannot stamp laminated documents.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Translation Issues:</b> Documents not in Arabic or English must have a certified legal translation.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"9\" id=\"6-do-i-need-to-be-physically-present-in-the-uae-for-attestation\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">6. Do I need to be physically present in the UAE for attestation?</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">No. You can use the online portal from anywhere if you have a <b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"128\">UAE Pass</b>. Alternatively, you can hire a professional service like <b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"194\">KPM PRO</b> to handle the entire end-to-end process, including the preliminary stamps required in your home country.</p>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Is MOFA attestation mandatory for a UAE residence visa?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes. Whether you are applying for an employment visa, a family sponsorship visa, or a gold visa, the UAE government requires MOFA attestation to verify that your foreign certificates (degree, marriage, or birth) are authentic and legally recognized within the country.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I complete the UAE MOFA attestation process online?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Absolutely. You can initiate the process via the official MOFA website or the MOFA UAE mobile app. After paying the fees online and choosing a courier service (like Emirates Post or Aramex), the courier will collect your physical documents, have them stamped at the ministry, and return them to your doorstep.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What are the MOFA attestation fees in the UAE for 2026?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"The standard fee for attesting individual documents (like educational or personal certificates) is AED 150. For commercial and corporate documents, the fees are significantly higher, typically starting around AED 2,000. Note that courier and service charges are calculated separately during the application.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How many days does it take to get a document attested by MOFA?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"The standard processing time is 0 to 3 working days. However, this depends on the courier speed you select (Normal, Next Day, or Express) and the accuracy of your application. Most digital-first applications are processed within 48 hours.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Why was my MOFA attestation request rejected?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"The most common reasons for rejection include missing prior stamps where your document must be attested by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in the issuing country and the UAE Embassy there before applying to MOFA UAE, lamination as MOFA cannot stamp laminated documents, and translation issues where documents not in Arabic or English must have a certified legal translation.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Do I need to be physically present in the UAE for attestation?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"No. You can use the online portal from anywhere if you have a UAE Pass. Alternatively, you can hire a professional service to handle the entire end-to-end process, including the preliminary stamps required in your home country.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script><!-- Simple Share Buttons Adder (8.5.6) simplesharebuttons.com --></p>\n<div class=\"ssba-modern-2 ssba ssbp-wrap aligncenter ssbp--theme-8\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<ul class=\"ssbp-list\">\n<li class=\"ssbp-li--facebook\"><a data-site=\"facebook\" class=\"ssba_facebook_share ssba_share_link ssbp-facebook ssbp-btn\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?t=MOFA%20Attestation%20in%20the%20UAE:%20Comprehensive%20Guide&amp;u=/mofa-attestation-in-the-uae/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#4267B2; background-color: #4267B2; height: 48px; width: 48px; \"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"#fff\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\">\n  <g>\n    <path d=\"m21.7 16.7h5v5h-5v11.6h-5v-11.6h-5v-5h5v-2.1c0-2 0.6-4.5 1.8-5.9 1.3-1.3 2.8-2 4.7-2h3.5v5h-3.5c-0.9 0-1.5 0.6-1.5 1.5v3.5z\"></path>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n<p></p></span><span class=\"color-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" 